Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.78,0:04:25.62,comments_v,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,0)\pos(1455,441)\frz280.9\bord0}真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.45,0:04:25.62,comments_h,,0,0,0,,{\pos(369,477)\3c&HF3F8CE&}9\N歲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.45,0:04:25.62,comments_h,,0,0,0,,{\pos(492,465)\3c&HD2D3F1&}10\N歲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.45,0:04:25.62,comments_h,,0,0,0,,{\pos(639,412.5)\3c&HBBFEBD&}11\N歲
