Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:48.79,comments_v,,0,0,0,,{\frz279.3\pos(540,687)}你搶到了真好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.96,0:10:55.63,comments_h,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\move(1144.8,52.5,1452,52.5,28,2072)}呵呵 碰到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.24,0:12:06.03,comments_h,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\pos(1652.4,52.5)}結果還是輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:23.02,comments_h,,0,0,0,,{\an9}真好 可以的話我也想對上A級
